msgid "triton-to-annotation"
msgstr "triton-to-annotation"

msgid "处理Ascend NPU特有的编译提示指令 (`tl.compile_hint`)，将其转换为后端的Annotation方言，用于指导后续的硬件特定优化或资源配置。"
msgstr "Process Ascend NPU-specific compilation hint instructions (`tl.compile_hint`), converting them into backend Annotation dialects to guide subsequent hardware-specific optimizations or resource allocation."

msgid "TritonAnnotationConversion"
msgstr "TritonAnnotationConversion"

msgid "将 `triton::AnnotationOp` 转换为 `annotation::MarkOp`，实现高级编译提示信息向底层注释标记的传递。"
msgstr "Convert `triton::AnnotationOp` to `annotation::MarkOp`, enabling the transfer of high-level compilation hint information to low-level annotation markers."

msgid "triton-to-hfusion"
msgstr "triton-to-hfusion"

msgid "将Triton中的`TTIR`转换为Ascend NPU硬件加速器`HFusion`方言中的对应操作"
msgstr "Convert `TTIR` in Triton to the corresponding operations in the Ascend NPU hardware accelerator `HFusion` dialect."

msgid "TritonHistogramToHFusionConversion"
msgstr "TritonHistogramToHFusionConversion"

msgid "将 `triton::HistogramOp` 转换为 `hfusion::HistogramOp`，使能在NPU的专用硬件上高效执行。"
msgstr "Convert `triton::HistogramOp` to `hfusion::HistogramOp` to enable efficient execution on NPU-specific hardware."

msgid "triton-to-hivm"
msgstr "triton-to-hivm"

msgid "处理Triton的块同步操作 (`tl.sync_block_all`, `tl.sync_block_set`, `tl.sync_block_wait`)，将其转换为Ascend NPU的`HIVM`方言中的跨核心同步指令。这些指令用于管理多核流水线中的同步与数据依赖，是流水优化的关键。"
msgstr "Process Triton's block synchronization operations (`tl.sync_block_all`, `tl.sync_block_set`, `tl.sync_block_wait`) and convert them into cross-core synchronization instructions in Ascend NPU's `HIVM` dialect. These instructions are used to manage synchronization and data dependencies in multi-core pipelines, and are key to pipeline optimization."

msgid "TritonCustomOpToHIVMSyncOpConversion"
msgstr "TritonCustomOpToHIVMSyncOpConversion"

msgid "实现Triton同步指令到HIVM同步指令的转换：<br>• `sync_block_all`：全局块同步<br>• `sync_block_set`：设置同步点<br>• `sync_block_wait`：等待同步点"
msgstr "Implement the conversion of Triton synchronization instructions to HIVM synchronization instructions:<br>• `sync_block_all`: Global block synchronization<br>• `sync_block_set`: Set synchronization point<br>• `sync_block_wait`: Wait for synchronization point"

msgid "triton-to-llvm"
msgstr "triton-to-llvm"

msgid "将Triton中的内联汇编操作 (`tl.inline_assembly`) 转换为LLVM方言的内联汇编，并最终映射为Ascend NPU的CCE硬件固有函数（Intrinsics）"
msgstr "Convert the inline assembly operations (`tl.inline_assembly`) in Triton to inline assembly in the LLVM dialect, and ultimately map them to the CCE hardware intrinsics of the Ascend NPU."

msgid "ElementwiseInlineAsmOpConversion"
msgstr "ElementwiseInlineAsmOpConversion"

msgid "将 `triton::ElementwiseInlineAsmOp` 转换为 `LLVM::InlineAsmOp`"
msgstr "Translate `triton::ElementwiseInlineAsmOp` to `LLVM::InlineAsmOp`."

msgid "3.2.3 Ascend affinitive Operators"
msgstr "3.2.3 Ascend Affinitive Operators"

msgid "Operator"
msgstr "Operator"

msgid "tl.custom_op"
msgstr "tl.custom_op"

msgid "Ascend NPU扩展的自定义算子集，用于支持硬件特定的内存访问与数据搬运模式，例如：<br>• `index_select`: 基于索引选择数据<br>• `index_put`: 基于索引放置数据<br>• `gather_out_to_ub`: 将外部数据收集到Unified Buffer (UB)<br>• `scatter_ub_to_out`: 将UB中的数据分散输出<br>• `indirect_load`: 间接地址加载<br>• `indirect_store`: 间接地址存储"
msgstr "Ascend NPU extension custom operator set, used to support hardware-specific memory access and data transfer patterns, for example:<br>• `index_select`: select data based on index<br>• `index_put`: place data based on index<br>• `gather_out_to_ub`: gather external data to Unified Buffer (UB)<br>• `scatter_ub_to_out`: scatter data from UB to output<br>• `indirect_load`: indirect address load<br>• `indirect_store`: indirect address store"

msgid "tl.compile_hint"
msgstr "tl.compile_hint"

msgid "向编译器传递硬件特定的编译提示信息，用于指导后端优化策略、资源分配或内核配置。"
msgstr "Pass hardware-specific compilation hints to the compiler to guide backend optimization strategies, resource allocation, or kernel configuration."

msgid "tl.sync_block_wait(`sender, receiver, event_id`)"
msgstr "tl.sync_block_wait(`sender, receiver, event_id`)"

msgid "块同步等待操作。指定接收核 (`receiver`) 等待由发送核 (`sender`) 发出的事件信号 (`event_id`)，用于管理跨核流水线中的数据依赖与执行顺序。"
msgstr "Block synchronization wait operation. Specifies that the receiving core (`receiver`) waits for an event signal (`event_id`) issued by the sending core (`sender`), used to manage data dependencies and execution order in cross-core pipelines."

msgid "tl.sync_block_set(`sender, receiver, event_id`)"
msgstr "tl.sync_block_set(`sender, receiver, event_id`)"

msgid "块同步设置操作。指定发送核 (`sender`) 向接收核 (`receiver`) 发出一个事件信号 (`event_id`)，表明某个执行阶段或数据已准备就绪。"
msgstr "Block synchronization setup operation. Specifies that the sender core (`sender`) sends an event signal (`event_id`) to the receiver core (`receiver`), indicating that a certain execution phase or data is ready."

msgid "tl.sync_block_all(`mode, event_id`)"
msgstr "tl.sync_block_all(`mode, event_id`)"

msgid "全局块同步操作。根据指定的同步模式 (`mode`)，向所有相关的接收核广播一个事件信号 (`event_id`)，用于实现全核同步或特定模式的集体同步。"
msgstr "Global block synchronization operation. According to the specified synchronization mode (`mode`), broadcast an event signal (`event_id`) to all relevant receiving cores to achieve full-core synchronization or collective synchronization in a specific mode."
